<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila flour mill rejects 23,500 U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Manila flour mill rejects 23,500 U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine flour mill on Tuesday rejected an offer of 23,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat due to high prices, traders said.</p>
<p>The mill had sought 16,000 tonnes U.S. dark northern spring wheat and 7,500 tonnes of western white wheat.</p>
</text>
